      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ la gyt we willað biddan freonda gehwylcne ⁊ eal folc eac læran georne, þæt hy inwerdre heortan ænne God lufian ⁊ ælcne hæþendom georne ascunian.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And now behold, we will beseech all our friends and likewise earnestly enjoin upon the whole nation, to love one God from their inmost heart, and zealously shun all heathen practices.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Not in D]</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
